sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Robot A (losing LOS)
    participant B as Robot B (candidate)
    participant C as Robot C (candidate)
    participant Topic as MQTT Broker<br/>(handoff/&lt;tid&gt;/#)

    Note over A: PredictionSERVICE flags<br/>High Risk of Occlusion
    A->>Topic: publish announce {tid, ts}
    Topic-->>B: announce
    Topic-->>C: announce

    Note over B,C: Each candidate computes<br/>U_i = w1*f_dist + w2*f_los + w3*f_batt + w4*f_load
    Note over B: random jitter backoff t_B
    Note over C: random jitter backoff t_C

    C->>Topic: publish bid {tid, rid=C, u=0.71, key}
    Topic-->>B: bid (C, u=0.71)
    Note over B: sees higher/equal bid before<br/>own timer fires -> may suppress
    B->>Topic: publish bid {tid, rid=B, u=0.68, key}
    Topic-->>C: bid (B, u=0.68)

    Note over B,C: Wait until T_negotiate elapses
    Note over C: C holds best (u,key) tuple -> self-declares winner
    C->>Topic: publish award {tid, rid=C} (QoS 2)
    Topic-->>A: award
    Topic-->>B: award

    Note over B: stops bidding, releases candidacy
    C->>Topic: publish ack {tid, rid=C}
    Note over A: hands off tracking context to C
